OL,3,ABrit Awards boosted Manchester economy
OL,4,Aby #5m, study finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Brit Awards' move to Manchester for
OL,7,Fthe 2026 ceremony generated #5 million
OL,8,Ffor the city and its surrounding area,
OL,9,Fresearch has found.
OL,11,FThe annual awards ceremony, widely
OL,12,Fregarded as the UK's biggest night in
OL,13,Fmusic, was hosted in city for the first
OL,14,Ftime this year after being held in the
OL,15,Fcapital for its near 50-year history.
OL,17,FThe move had a positive economic and
OL,18,Fsocial impact and created more than
OL,19,F3,000 temporary jobs, according to an
OL,20,Findependent study conducted by Amion
OL,21,FConsulting.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
