OL,3,ABrit Awards boosted Manchester economy
OL,4,Aby #5m, study finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Manchester mayor Bev Craig
OL,7,Fpraised the awards' move north as a
OL,8,F"massive moment for our city region",
OL,9,Fwith the 2027 event also set to be held
OL,10,Fin the city.
